		<item>
			<title>Christopher Hitchens on the Larry Craig sex scandal</title>
			<link>http://www.clairewolfe.com/wolfesblog/00002665.html</link>
			<description>GAWD, CHRISTOPHER HITCHENS IS A GREAT WRITER. His take on the Larry Craig sex scandal is a hoot. I don&apos;t know or care what Craig did in that airport bathroom. I agree that sex-trolling cops do more harm than their targets. But Hitchens nails it when it comes to risk and denial in the lives of closeted moralizers. And whoever would have imagined that anybody ever wrote a Ph.D. dissertation on ...&#10;</description>
